1
00:00:00,967 --> 00:00:02,637
(Howard:)All right.

2
00:00:06,139 --> 00:00:07,809
(Leonard:)I just hit my head.

3
00:00:08,683 --> 00:00:10,353
(Howard:)Because you didn't keep true.

4
00:00:13,104 --> 00:00:15,354
(Howard:)Okay, turn right.

5
00:00:15,982 --> 00:00:17,982
(Raj:)The picture's breaking up.

6
00:00:18,151 --> 00:00:19,821
(Howard:)Angle your head to the right.

7
00:00:21,070 --> 00:00:22,950
Now, a little more.

8
00:00:23,114 --> 00:00:24,614
(Sheldon:)Little more.

9
00:00:25,116 --> 00:00:27,656
(Howard:)That's it. Now just keep true.

10
00:00:30,496 --> 00:00:34,296
All right, you're close enough
to Sheldon's room. Deploy the sensor.

11
00:00:35,585 --> 00:00:37,295
(Howard:)Now turn it on.

12
00:00:37,461 --> 00:00:40,001
- It wasn't on?
- No.

13
00:00:40,173 --> 00:00:42,133
(Leonard:)Then why did I have to crawl?

14
00:00:43,551 --> 00:00:45,511
(Howard:)Oh, I guess you didn't.

15
00:00:48,723 --> 00:00:49,853
(Leonard:)Okay, it's on.

16
00:00:50,016 --> 00:00:53,766
(Howard:)Good. From this point forward,
you will have to crawl.

17
00:00:55,021 --> 00:00:57,061
(Howard:)I know.

18
00:00:58,941 --> 00:01:00,021
[BEEPING]

